recommend keep-going -- the REDS pin closes 36 bytes under with one CLOSED row foldable, so the next lap opens by folding it; then the 301 remaining write-time pens, wiping subset first, now that a hold is known to lose. Whether the doorway roster may reach foundations/ -- 65 of 83 naming no room, 18 of the 20 rota pages among them -- stays Keaton's, since the ceiling only falls.
